const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文研究企业在进口救济调查背景下是否会出现与报告激励相关的应计项目行为。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"The paper studies whether firms exhibit accrual behavior associated with reporting incentives during import-relief investigations. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.2307/2491047",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research (1991) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research (1991) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"来源围绕一类受制度约束的调查事件，比较公司报告变量与调查时点之间的关系。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It relates reporting variables to the timing of a legally bounded investigation event for a defined firm sample. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.2307/2491047",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research (1991) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research (1991) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要财务报表项目、应计项目构造、调查事件日期、公司身份、会计期间与公告可得时点。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"Inputs include financial-statement items, accrual construction, investigation dates, firm identity, accounting periods, and disclosure availability. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.2307/2491047",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research (1991) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research (1991) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"该研究讨论特定制度激励下的报告选择，不能把应计项目变化本身直接等同于故意操纵。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"It concerns reporting choice under a particular institutional incentive; an accrual change alone is not evidence of intentional manipulation. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not convert association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.2307/2491047",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research (1991) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research (1991) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"保存原始申报及修订版本，区分财报期末与可得日期，明确事件样本纳入规则和行业或公司对照。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Keep original and restated filings; distinguish period end from availability; define event inclusion and industry or firm controls. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.2307/2491047",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research (1991) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research (1991) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Journal of Accounting Research (1991)。特定贸易调查环境和历史会计准则限制外推；该导读不提供舞弊识别、合规判断或公司评价。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Journal of Accounting Research (1991). The trade-investigation setting and historical accounting rules limit extrapolation; this guide offers no fraud finding, compliance view, or company assessment. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.2307/2491047",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research (1991) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research (1991) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Earnings Management During Import Relief Investigations”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。特定贸易调查环境和历史会计准则限制外推；该导读不提供舞弊识别、合规判断或公司评价。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Earnings Management During Import Relief Investigations”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
